WEBVTT

NOTE ScanPass product video narration. Source: ScanPass product_video, video-config.yaml.

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.654
Events in Sri Lanka bring thousands of people together.

2
00:00:03.654 --> 00:00:07.839
Managing credentials, verifying identities, controlling access,

3
00:00:07.839 --> 00:00:11.360
these are real challenges that every organiser faces.

4
00:00:12.667 --> 00:00:15.597
ScanPass was built to solve exactly that.

5
00:00:21.333 --> 00:00:24.922
Registrants apply from their phones, anywhere, any time.

6
00:00:24.922 --> 00:00:29.665
They fill in their details, upload their documents, and submit in minutes.

7
00:00:29.665 --> 00:00:31.203
No queues. No paperwork.

8
00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:49.645
Organisers review each application from their dashboard and approve with a single click.

9
00:00:49.645 --> 00:00:51.890
The credential is issued instantly.

10
00:01:02.667 --> 00:01:07.447
The registrant receives their QR credential on their phone, ready for event day.

11
00:01:13.333 --> 00:01:15.973
On event day, entry is fast and secure.

12
00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:26.310
Your team scans the QR code.

13
00:01:26.310 --> 00:01:33.735
ScanPass verifies the credential in real time, confirms identity, and displays the result.

14
00:01:33.735 --> 00:01:35.550
Valid. Approved. Done.

15
00:01:40.667 --> 00:01:44.337
Throughout the event, your dashboard shows everything.

16
00:01:44.337 --> 00:01:46.580
Arrivals. Approvals. Scan counts.

17
00:01:46.580 --> 00:01:49.707
Real-time visibility across your entire event.

18
00:01:52.333 --> 00:01:56.694
ScanPass. From registration to gate, built for Sri Lanka.

19
00:01:56.694 --> 00:01:58.913
Contact us at scanpasslk.com.
